OL,3,GNEWSAHosepipe ban lifted after rain
OL,4,Arefills reservoirs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hosepipe ban has been lifted after
OL,7,Fthe local river and reservoirs were
OL,8,Freplenished by recent rainfall.
OL,10,FBristol Water announced the
OL,11,Frestrictions on 27 August, following a
OL,12,Fperiod of prolonged dry weather. It was
OL,13,Fthe supplier's first hosepipe ban
OL,14,Fcaused by drought in more than 50
OL,15,Fyears.
OL,17,FThe restrictions ended at 09:00 GMT,
OL,18,Ftwo weeks after the Environment Agency
OL,19,Fwithdrew its drought order application
OL,20,Ffor the River Severn.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
