OL,3,GNEWSAHosepipe ban lifted after rain
OL,4,Arefills reservoirs
OL,5,
OL,6,FRichard Stanbrook, water services
OL,7,Fdirector at Bristol Water, thanked
OL,8,Fcustomers for reducing usage, adding:
OL,9,F"We know the ban has been an
OL,10,Finconvenience, and the water people
OL,11,Fhave saved has helped us protect
OL,12,Fsupplies and the environment during the
OL,13,Fdrought."
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
